    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψῐ-κέρως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>,
